WEBVTT

00:03.280 --> 00:04.680
Leave tonight

00:05.600 --> 00:06.680
First

00:06.760 --> 00:08.800
I am truly worried about Father's health

00:08.880 --> 00:09.560
Second

00:09.640 --> 00:10.640
Our dynasty values filial piety

00:10.720 --> 00:11.920
If I don't return

00:12.000 --> 00:14.120
I'm afraid it will give Prince Ning ammunition

00:14.200 --> 00:15.867
To criticize me in court

00:21.500 --> 00:29.000
Half a month later, you led a troop of personal guards back to the capital to visit the Emperor.

00:29.080 --> 00:32.000
Supplies burned to ashes, military resolve faltered. Xie Xuan fought on alone for days, but was ultimately overwhelmed by vastly superior numbers, resulting in the annihilation of his entire army.

00:35.600 --> 00:37.000
Elder brother

00:37.200 --> 00:38.600
Father's health

00:38.760 --> 00:40.360
His Majesty is unwell

00:40.760 --> 00:42.427
Resting in a separate palace

00:42.840 --> 00:44.240
All palace affairs

00:44.480 --> 00:46.147
Are all handled by me

00:49.240 --> 00:50.640
Elder brother

00:51.360 --> 00:53.027
I want to see Father

00:59.760 --> 01:01.160
Second brother

01:01.760 --> 01:02.320
All these years

01:02.400 --> 01:04.200
You've been fighting with blades and swords

01:04.280 --> 01:05.680
You've been wild enough

01:07.000 --> 01:07.640
Today

01:07.760 --> 01:09.427
Let me welcome you back

01:11.880 --> 01:14.213
Elder brother, I want to see Father

01:15.000 --> 01:17.000
Elder brother, what are you doing?

01:18.520 --> 01:19.920
Sikong Zheng

01:32.880 --> 01:35.880
I really didn't want it to come to this

01:36.360 --> 01:37.760
But second brother

01:39.120 --> 01:41.080
You already have a foundation in the army

01:41.240 --> 01:43.160
How can I, the crown prince

01:43.240 --> 01:44.760
Sleep peacefully?

